-------------------------------------------------------------------------
Bundled and derived works
-------------------------------------------------------------------------

LRM Mobile is a platform, build and installation layer around LRM:

    LRM — https://github.com/hacvilke/lrm
    Copyright 2026 LRM authors
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

No LRM source code is copied into this repository. LRM is consumed as a
git submodule at third_party/lrm, pinned to a specific commit, and is
compiled unmodified. Binaries released by this project therefore contain
LRM's code and are distributed under the same Apache-2.0 terms.

LRM Mobile has no third-party Go dependencies beyond LRM itself and the
Go standard library.
